		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>C&#039;est la version 9.0.13 qui est installée.<br />Quand j&#039;execute le code :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>-- the generic crosstab function:
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION crosstab(text)
RETURNS setof record
AS &#039;MODULE_PATHNAME&#039;,&#039;crosstab&#039;
LANGUAGE C STABLE STRICT;</code></pre></div><p>J&#039;ai l&#039;erreur &quot;permission denied for language c&quot; !</p>]]></content>
